","industry":"Industrial Distribution","summary":"Invicta Holdings Limited, an investment holding company, engages in the distribution of engineering components and consumables in South Africa, the Rest of Africa, Europe, and Asia. It operates through Replacement Parts for Industrial Equipment; Replacement Parts for Auto and Agri; Capital Equipment and Related Services; Replacement Parts for Earthmoving Equipment; Kian Ann Group; and Corporate Group segment. The company offers technical services, including on-site installation, maintenance work, breakdown repair, condition monitoring, failure analysis, design engineering, and manufacturing services. It also supplies engineering consumables, such as bearings, seals and gaskets, power transmissions, light and heavy materials handling, fasteners, geared and electric drives, and motors; fluid technology products and solutions comprising hydraulic, pneumatic, valves, pumps, filtration, hose, fittings, and lubrication; tools and equipment, cutting, welding, lifting, personal protective equipment, locks, and machine tools; imported and local vibrator motors, tensioning, and suspension systems; and vibrating equipment and material handling solutions; and products for the automotive, truck, and bus segments. In addition, the company manufactures and supplies heavy-duty belting components and imported conveyer belting to the industry; wholesale and retail distribution of earthmoving and materials-handling equipment; supplies and distributes original equipment manufacturer parts and components; and offers after-market replacement spare parts, ground engaging tools, and undercarriage parts for earthmoving equipment. Further, it provides bearings, belts, bushes, and seals; heavy machinery parts and diesel engine components for excavators, bulldozers, wheel loaders, motor graders, trucks, trailers, power generation sets and marine engines; and value-added assembly services. Invicta Holdings Limited was incorporated in 1960 and is based in Johannesburg, South Africa.","employees":null,"website":"https://www.invictaholdings.co.za","country":"South Africa","city":"Johannesburg","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Steven Brian Joffe B.Com., C.A.","title":"CEO & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Nazlee  Rajmohamed B.Com., C.A.","title":"CFO & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Sade L. Lekena","title":"Company Secretary & Group Legal Counsel"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":5.679,"tpe":6.989,"ps":0.3575,"pfcf":9.62,"peg":null,"pb":0.7313,"ev_ebitda":4.137,"rev_growth":0.024,"eps_growth":0.014,"eps_growth_fwd":0.079,"eps_growth_next":0.1379,"div_yield":0.0333,"roe":0.1214,"roa":0.05464,"de":33.82,"gross_margin":0.2246,"op_margin":0.08525,"profit_margin":0.05449,"current_ratio":1.771},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":3.553,"sector":5.679,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":5.224,"sector":6.989,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":0.2986,"sector":0.3575,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":-1,"sector":9.62,"verdict":"Negative FCF"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":null,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":0.4686,"sector":0.7313,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":39.55,"sector":33.82,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.023,"sector":0.024,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":-0.447,"sector":0.014,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.2714,"sector":0.079,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth_next","label":"EPS growth (next year, est.)","v":0.1974,"sector":0.1379,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"gross_margin","label":"Gross margin","v":0.3306,"sector":0.2246,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"op_margin","label":"Operating margin","v":0.08525,"sector":0.08525,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"profit_margin","label":"Net margin","v":0.05817,"sector":0.05449,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"roe","label"